# Root .dockerignore for the MCP image (build context is the repo root).
# Allowlist only what src/mcp/Dockerfile copies. A broad context (.venv,
# .azure, node_modules) makes remote ACR builds fail with
# "archive/tar: write too long".
*
!src/mcp/*.py
!src/mcp/requirements.lock
!specs/sample-data/**
**/__pycache__
